WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.324
Today we will compose a simple shared musical phrase. Our work connects with selected

00:00:05.324 --> 00:00:07.155
artists and traditions in Ghana.

00:00:08.033 --> 00:00:13.272
Write or say a short call about caring for people or places. Name a design choice

00:00:13.272 --> 00:00:15.564
that a selected Ghanaian artist might make.

00:00:16.367 --> 00:00:18.948
Invent an easy response of similar length.

00:00:20.367 --> 00:00:23.460
Practise taking turns as leader and responding group.
